---
/*
 * The dependency rule of Clean Architecture, drawn with the real folder
 * names of this project. Rings draw from the centre outwards once on load.
 */
---

<svg
  class="diagram"
  viewBox="0 0 400 400"
  role="img"
  aria-labelledby="diagram-title diagram-desc"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
>
  <title id="diagram-title">Architecture of this site</title>
  <desc id="diagram-desc">
    Three concentric rings. The domain sits at the centre, surrounded by the application layer. The
    outer ring is split between presentation and infrastructure. Arrows point inward: outer layers
    depend on inner layers, never the reverse.
  </desc>

  <circle class="ring ring--outer" cx="200" cy="200" r="180" pathLength="1"></circle>
  <line class="divider" x1="200" y1="20" x2="200" y2="80"></line>
  <line class="divider" x1="200" y1="320" x2="200" y2="380"></line>
  <circle class="ring ring--middle" cx="200" cy="200" r="120" pathLength="1"></circle>
  <circle class="ring ring--core" cx="200" cy="200" r="60" pathLength="1"></circle>

  <g class="arrows">
    <path d="M34 200h36m-8-6 8 6-8 6"></path>
    <path d="M366 200h-36m8-6-8 6 8 6"></path>
    <path d="M94 200h36m-8-6 8 6-8 6"></path>
    <path d="M306 200h-36m8-6-8 6 8 6"></path>
  </g>

  <g class="labels">
    <text x="146" y="60">
      presentation
    </text>
    <text x="256" y="60">
      infrastructure
    </text>
    <text x="200" y="112">
      application
    </text>
    <text class="label--core" x="200" y="206">
      domain
    </text>
  </g>
</svg>

<style>
  .diagram {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 26rem;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .ring {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--graphite);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .ring--core {
    fill: var(--cobalt-wash);
    stroke: var(--cobalt);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .divider {
    stroke: var(--rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .arrows path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--cobalt);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .labels text {
    font-family: var(--font-family);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-stretch: 85%;
    font-weight: 500;
    fill: var(--graphite);
    text-anchor: middle;
  }

  .labels .label--core {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-stretch: 100%;
    fill: var(--cobalt);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .ring {
      stroke-dasharray: 1;
      stroke-dashoffset: 1;
      animation: draw 700ms cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1) forwards;
    }

    .ring--middle {
      animation-delay: 220ms;
    }

    .ring--outer {
      animation-delay: 440ms;
    }

    .divider,
    .arrows,
    .labels {
      opacity: 0;
      animation: appear 400ms ease-out 900ms forwards;
    }
  }

  @keyframes draw {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
  }

  @keyframes appear {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
